content.summary:
Motor vehicles transporting hazardous materials or hazardous waste shall operate at
               all times with their headlights illuminated.
(Code 1981, § 17-115; Ord. No. 2204, § 1, 9-3-1985;
Ord. No. 4561, § 2, 8-29-2016
)

